  <h1 class="page-title">Provider <em>price benchmarks.</em></h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: 24 April 2026 · refreshed quarterly</p>
  <p class="byline">By the LLM CFO team</p>

  <p class="lede">Reference prices per 1M tokens across the five major frontier providers. Numbers come from public price pages on the date above. Cache-read and batch-API discounts are tracked separately because they're billed separately on real invoices.</p>

  <div class="callout"><strong>How to use:</strong> these are list prices. Real engagement pricing factors enterprise discounts, committed-use, and cross-region routing. Treat the numbers below as an upper bound, not a quote.</div>

